<%# A spell or an item on the summary sheet whose details open on demand, in the window of the sheet
    (shared/_details_dialog, decision: as at the Spells step, rather than a fold under the line). Its line is the
    button, with an info icon after it (decision of 26 November: before it, the icon pushed the names of a list out of
    line with those that have none, and with the heading of the list); details_dialog_controller.js shows it and copies the details into the window, its name
    (title) and its short line (subtitle) in the title bar. Without JavaScript, a native details opens them under the
    line. Rendered as a layout around the line:
    render layout: "character_sheets/summary/entry_details", locals: { title:, subtitle:, description:, details: } do ... end
    details: what the window shows (the details of a spell), else the description. Without either, the line alone %>
<% line = yield %>
<% details = local_assigns[:details].presence ||
             (tag.p(description, class: "whitespace-pre-line leading-relaxed text-sm text-ink") if description.present?) %>
<% if details %>
  <div>
    <button type="button" hidden aria-haspopup="dialog"
            class="flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-2 rounded-sm text-left text-sm [&:hover>span:first-child]:underline"
            data-details-dialog-target="opener" data-action="details-dialog#open"
            data-details-dialog-name-param="<%= title %>" data-details-dialog-summary-param="<%= local_assigns[:subtitle] %>">
      <%= line %>
      <span class="shrink-0 self-center text-muted" aria-hidden="true"><%= render "shared/icons/info", css_class: "size-3.5" %></span>
    </button>
    <details class="group text-sm" data-details-dialog-target="fold">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-baseline gap-2 rounded-sm [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <span class="self-center text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-90" aria-hidden="true">
          <%= render "shared/icons/chevron_right", css_class: "size-3.5" %>
        </span>
        <%= line %>
      </summary>
      <div class="mt-1 mb-2 ml-5.5">
        <div data-details-dialog-content><%= details %></div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
<% else %>
  <p class="flex items-baseline gap-2 text-sm"><%= line %></p>
<% end %>
